globalThis.EluceniaToolLocales={"id":"vef1-dlco-pos-operatorio","clinicalApproval":"not-performed","professionalLanguageApproval":"not-performed","locales":{"pt-BR":{"tool":{"id":"vef1-dlco-pos-operatorio","title":"VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios","summary":"Risco da ressecção pulmonar pela contagem de segmentos","lead":"Para lobectomia ou segmentectomia, usa a contagem inicial de segmentos funcionantes (19 menos os obstruídos). Para pneumonectomia, exige a percentagem medida da perfusão total atribuída ao pulmão a ressecar. O método segmentar não substitui essa medição. A função prevista é calculada dentro da ELUCENIA; o resultado isolado não aprova cirurgia.","fields":[["mode","Método de estimativa","sel",{"opt":true,"defaultValue":"segmental","opts":{"segmental":"Contagem de segmentos funcionantes","perfusion":"Perfusão pulmonar medida"}}],["vef1","VEF₁ pré-operatório (pós-broncodilatador)","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% do previsto","ph":"75"}],["dlco","DLCO pré-operatória","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% do previsto","ph":"70","opt":true}],["seg","Segmentos <strong>funcionantes</strong> que serão ressecados","num",{"min":1,"max":19,"ph":"5","integer":true,"step":1,"opt":true}],["obs","Segmentos obstruídos (não funcionantes) no pulmão todo","num",{"min":0,"max":18,"ph":"0","opt":true,"integer":true,"step":1}],["perfusao","Perfusão do pulmão a ressecar","num",{"min":0,"max":100,"unit":"% da perfusão total","ph":"50","opt":true}]],"formula":"<p><strong>Modo segmentar:</strong> PPO = valor pré-operatório × (1 − y/z), em que y é a contagem de segmentos funcionantes a ressecar e z = 19 menos a contagem de segmentos obstruídos. Os segmentos são contagens inteiras e y não pode superar z.</p><p><strong>Modo por perfusão:</strong> PPO = valor pré-operatório × (1 − P/100), em que P é a percentagem medida da perfusão total atribuída ao pulmão a ressecar. Esta fração não é inferida da contagem de segmentos.</p><p>A equação é aplicada separadamente ao VEF₁ e à DLCO. Sem DLCO, o resultado é um VEF₁ parcial e a avaliação permanece incompleta. A escolha clínica da intervenção e da estratégia de avaliação exige revisão profissional.</p>","sources":[["Brunelli A et al. Physiologic evaluation of the patient with lung cancer being considered for resectional surgery: diagnosis and management of lung cancer, 3rd ed: American College of Chest Physicians evidence-based clinical practice guidelines. Chest, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.1378/chest.12-2395"],["Brunelli A et al. ERS/ESTS clinical guidelines on fitness for radical therapy in lung cancer patients (surgery and chemo-radiotherapy). Eur Respir J, 2009.","https://doi.org/10.1183/09031936.00184308"]],"methodVersion":"ERS/ESTS 2009, página 22: estimativa inicial por segmentos funcionantes e fórmula pré-pneumonectomia por fração de perfusão medida; cortes do resumo ACCP 2013: ambos >60%, algum entre 30–60% e algum <30%; sem conformidade clínica integral","limits":"Estimativa para avaliação funcional de candidatos a ressecção pulmonar, com valores pré-operatórios em percentagem do previsto. Escolha o método compatível com a intervenção: contagem segmentar como estimativa inicial; na pneumonectomia, informe a perfusão medida do pulmão a ressecar. Não se deduz perfusão a partir de 19 segmentos. Informe segmentos como contagens inteiras; a contagem a ressecar não pode superar 19 menos os obstruídos. Perfusão de 0–100% é o domínio matemático da implementação; 0% e 100% não demonstram elegibilidade cirúrgica. Sem DLCO, apenas VEF₁ parcial e avaliação incompleta. Algoritmos cardiovasculares, testes de exercício, correção de 2014 e artigo ACCP integral não foram conferidos neste lote. A fonte ERS/ESTS 2009 foi lida nesta página específica; a fonte ACCP 2013, no resumo. Revisão clínica e tradução profissional não realizadas.","limitsLocale":"pt-BR","resultLabels":{"VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios":"VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Selecione","yes":"Sim","no":"Não","optional":"opcional","numeric":"Valor numérico","range":"intervalo","calculate":"Calcular","calculating":"Calculando…","clear":"Limpar","heading":"Calcular com transparência","intro":"Confira população, unidades e versão. O resultado apresenta a fórmula ou classificação, sem decisão terapêutica automática.","restricted":"Ficha disponível para consulta","restrictedNote":"Cálculo suspenso nesta edição. O inventário, a pendência e as fontes permanecem públicos.","resultNote":"Resultado da fórmula ou classificação. Interpretação, conduta e aplicabilidade dependem da avaliação profissional e da fonte selecionada.","invalid":"Não foi possível calcular com esses valores. Confira as condições de uso.","unavailable":"O serviço de cálculo está indisponível. Tente novamente.","connection":"Não foi possível consultar o serviço de cálculo. Verifique a conexão e tente novamente.","check":"Confira os valores informados.","fleischner":"Antes de calcular: referência para nódulos pulmonares incidentais. As recomendações não se aplicam a pessoas com menos de 35 anos, rastreamento de câncer de pulmão, imunossupressão ou câncer primário conhecido.","incompleteAssessment":"Sem avaliação completa, não é possível calcular a pontuação total."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · código de integração","clinical":"Revisão clínica independente não realizada.","conditions":"condições, fontes e permissões","record":"Ficha e referências","code":"Código JavaScript","cases":"Casos de referência","language":"Idioma","formula":"Fórmula documentada","edition":"Edição do método","limits":"Limites e população","references":"Referências"}},"en":{"tool":{"id":"vef1-dlco-pos-operatorio","title":"Predicted postoperative FEV₁ and DLCO","titleLocale":"en","summary":"Lung resection risk from segment count","lead":"For lobectomy or segmentectomy, it uses the initial functioning segment count (19 minus the obstructed segments). For pneumonectomy, it requires the measured percentage of total perfusion attributable to the lung to be resected. The segmental method does not replace this measurement. Predicted function is calculated within ELUCENIA; the result alone does not approve surgery.","fields":[["mode","Estimation method","sel",{"opt":true,"defaultValue":"segmental","opts":{"segmental":"Functioning segment count","perfusion":"Measured pulmonary perfusion"},"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en","optionLocales":{"segmental":"en","perfusion":"en"}}],["vef1","Preoperative FEV₁ (postbronchodilator)","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% of predicted","ph":"75","unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["dlco","Preoperative DLCO","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% of predicted","ph":"70","opt":true,"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["seg","<strong>Functioning</strong> segments to be resected","num",{"min":1,"max":19,"ph":"5","integer":true,"step":1,"opt":true,"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["obs","Obstructed (nonfunctioning) segments in the whole lung","num",{"min":0,"max":18,"ph":"0","opt":true,"integer":true,"step":1,"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}],["perfusao","Perfusion of the lung to be resected","num",{"min":0,"max":100,"unit":"% of total perfusion","ph":"50","opt":true,"unitLocale":"en","displayLocale":"en"}]],"formula":"<p><strong>Segmental mode:</strong> PPO = preoperative value × (1 − y/z), where y is the number of functioning segments to be resected and z = 19 minus the number of obstructed segments. Segments are integer counts, and y cannot exceed z.</p><p><strong>Perfusion mode:</strong> PPO = preoperative value × (1 − P/100), where P is the measured percentage of total perfusion attributable to the lung to be resected. This fraction is not inferred from the segment count.</p><p>The equation is applied separately to FEV₁ and DLCO. Without DLCO, the result is a partial FEV₁ result and the assessment remains incomplete. Clinical selection of the intervention and assessment strategy requires professional review.</p>","sources":[["Brunelli A et al. Physiologic evaluation of the patient with lung cancer being considered for resectional surgery: diagnosis and management of lung cancer, 3rd ed: American College of Chest Physicians evidence-based clinical practice guidelines. Chest, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.1378/chest.12-2395"],["Brunelli A et al. ERS/ESTS clinical guidelines on fitness for radical therapy in lung cancer patients (surgery and chemo-radiotherapy). Eur Respir J, 2009.","https://doi.org/10.1183/09031936.00184308"]],"methodVersion":"ERS/ESTS 2009, page 22: initial estimate from functioning segments and pre-pneumonectomy formula using the measured perfusion fraction; thresholds from the ACCP 2013 abstract: both >60%, either between 30–60%, and either <30%; no complete clinical conformance","methodVersionLocale":"en","limits":"An estimate for functional assessment of lung resection candidates, with preoperative values expressed as percentages of predicted values. Select the method appropriate to the intervention: segment counting for an initial estimate; for pneumonectomy, enter the measured perfusion of the lung to be resected. Perfusion is not deduced from 19 segments. Enter segments as integer counts; the number to be resected cannot exceed 19 minus the obstructed segments. Perfusion of 0–100% is the implementation's mathematical domain; 0% and 100% do not establish surgical eligibility. Without DLCO, only a partial FEV₁ result and an incomplete assessment are available. Cardiovascular algorithms, exercise tests, the 2014 correction, and the full ACCP article were not checked in this batch. The ERS/ESTS 2009 source was read on this specific page; the ACCP 2013 source was read in abstract form. Clinical review and professional translation were not performed.","limitsLocale":"en","resultLabels":{"Menor valor previsto pós-operatório (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"Lower predicted postoperative value (FEV₁ or DLCO)","VEF₁ previsto pós-operatório":"Predicted postoperative FEV₁","Menor valor PPO por perfusão (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"Lower perfusion-based PPO value (FEV₁ or DLCO)","VEF₁ parcial por perfusão: DLCO não informada":"Partial perfusion-based FEV₁: DLCO not provided","VEF₁ parcial: DLCO não informada":"Partial FEV₁ estimate: DLCO not provided","VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios":"Predicted postoperative FEV₁ and DLCO"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Select","yes":"Yes","no":"No","optional":"optional","numeric":"Numeric value","range":"range","calculate":"Calculate","calculating":"Calculating…","clear":"Clear","heading":"Calculate with transparency","intro":"Check the population, units and version. The result shows the formula or classification; it does not make an automatic treatment decision.","restricted":"Record available for reference","restrictedNote":"Calculation is suspended in this release. The inventory, outstanding review and sources remain public.","resultNote":"Formula or classification result. Interpretation, care and applicability depend on professional assessment and the selected source.","invalid":"Unable to calculate with these values. Check the conditions of use.","unavailable":"The calculation service is unavailable. Try again.","connection":"Unable to reach the calculation service. Check your connection and try again.","check":"Check the values entered.","fleischner":"Before calculating: reference for incidental pulmonary nodules. The recommendations do not apply to people under 35, lung cancer screening, immunosuppression or known primary cancer.","incompleteAssessment":"A total score cannot be calculated without a complete assessment."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · integration code","clinical":"Independent clinical review has not been performed.","conditions":"conditions, sources and permissions","record":"Record and references","code":"JavaScript code","cases":"Reference cases","language":"Language","formula":"Documented formula","edition":"Method edition","limits":"Limits and population","references":"References"}},"es":{"tool":{"id":"vef1-dlco-pos-operatorio","title":"FEV₁ y DLCO previstos posoperatorios","titleLocale":"es","summary":"Riesgo de resección pulmonar por recuento de segmentos","lead":"Para la lobectomía o la segmentectomía, utiliza el recuento inicial de segmentos funcionantes (19 menos los obstruidos). Para la neumonectomía, exige el porcentaje medido de la perfusión total atribuible al pulmón que se va a resecar. El método segmentario no sustituye esta medición. La función prevista se calcula dentro de ELUCENIA; el resultado aislado no aprueba la cirugía.","fields":[["mode","Método de estimación","sel",{"opt":true,"defaultValue":"segmental","opts":{"segmental":"Recuento de segmentos funcionantes","perfusion":"Perfusión pulmonar medida"},"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es","optionLocales":{"segmental":"es","perfusion":"es"}}],["vef1","FEV₁ preoperatorio (tras broncodilatador)","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% del valor previsto","ph":"75","unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["dlco","DLCO preoperatoria","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% del valor previsto","ph":"70","opt":true,"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["seg","Segmentos <strong>funcionantes</strong> que se resecarán","num",{"min":1,"max":19,"ph":"5","integer":true,"step":1,"opt":true,"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["obs","Segmentos obstruidos (no funcionantes) en todo el pulmón","num",{"min":0,"max":18,"ph":"0","opt":true,"integer":true,"step":1,"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}],["perfusao","Perfusión del pulmón que se va a resecar","num",{"min":0,"max":100,"unit":"% de la perfusión total","ph":"50","opt":true,"unitLocale":"es","displayLocale":"es"}]],"formula":"<p><strong>Modo segmentario:</strong> PPO = valor preoperatorio × (1 − y/z), donde y es el número de segmentos funcionantes que se van a resecar y z = 19 menos el número de segmentos obstruidos. Los segmentos son recuentos enteros e y no puede superar z.</p><p><strong>Modo por perfusión:</strong> PPO = valor preoperatorio × (1 − P/100), donde P es el porcentaje medido de la perfusión total atribuible al pulmón que se va a resecar. Esta fracción no se infiere del recuento de segmentos.</p><p>La ecuación se aplica por separado al VEF₁ y a la DLCO. Sin DLCO, el resultado es un VEF₁ parcial y la evaluación permanece incompleta. La elección clínica de la intervención y de la estrategia de evaluación exige una revisión profesional.</p>","sources":[["Brunelli A et al. Physiologic evaluation of the patient with lung cancer being considered for resectional surgery: diagnosis and management of lung cancer, 3rd ed: American College of Chest Physicians evidence-based clinical practice guidelines. Chest, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.1378/chest.12-2395"],["Brunelli A et al. ERS/ESTS clinical guidelines on fitness for radical therapy in lung cancer patients (surgery and chemo-radiotherapy). Eur Respir J, 2009.","https://doi.org/10.1183/09031936.00184308"]],"methodVersion":"ERS/ESTS 2009, página 22: estimación inicial mediante segmentos funcionantes y fórmula previa a la neumonectomía basada en la fracción de perfusión medida; puntos de corte del resumen ACCP 2013: ambos >60%, alguno entre 30–60% y alguno <30%; sin conformidad clínica integral","methodVersionLocale":"es","limits":"Estimación para la evaluación funcional de candidatos a resección pulmonar, con valores preoperatorios expresados como porcentaje del valor previsto. Elija el método compatible con la intervención: recuento segmentario como estimación inicial; para la neumonectomía, indique la perfusión medida del pulmón que se va a resecar. No se deduce la perfusión a partir de 19 segmentos. Introduzca los segmentos como recuentos enteros; el número que se va a resecar no puede superar 19 menos los obstruidos. La perfusión de 0–100% es el dominio matemático de la implementación; el 0% y el 100% no demuestran elegibilidad quirúrgica. Sin DLCO, solo hay un VEF₁ parcial y una evaluación incompleta. No se comprobaron en este lote los algoritmos cardiovasculares, las pruebas de ejercicio, la corrección de 2014 ni el artículo ACCP completo. La fuente ERS/ESTS 2009 se leyó en esta página concreta; la fuente ACCP 2013, en su resumen. No se realizaron una revisión clínica ni una traducción profesional.","limitsLocale":"es","resultLabels":{"Menor valor previsto pós-operatório (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"Menor valor previsto posoperatorio (VEF₁ o DLCO)","VEF₁ previsto pós-operatório":"VEF₁ previsto posoperatorio","Menor valor PPO por perfusão (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"Menor valor PPO por perfusión (VEF₁ o DLCO)","VEF₁ parcial por perfusão: DLCO não informada":"VEF₁ parcial por perfusión: DLCO no proporcionada","VEF₁ parcial: DLCO não informada":"Estimación parcial del VEF₁: DLCO no informada","VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios":"FEV₁ y DLCO previstos posoperatorios"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Seleccione","yes":"Sí","no":"No","optional":"opcional","numeric":"Valor numérico","range":"intervalo","calculate":"Calcular","calculating":"Calculando…","clear":"Limpiar","heading":"Calcular con transparencia","intro":"Compruebe la población, las unidades y la versión. El resultado presenta la fórmula o clasificación, sin decisión terapéutica automática.","restricted":"Ficha disponible para consulta","restrictedNote":"Cálculo suspendido en esta edición. El inventario, la revisión pendiente y las fuentes siguen siendo públicos.","resultNote":"Resultado de la fórmula o clasificación. La interpretación, la conducta y la aplicabilidad dependen de la evaluación profesional y de la fuente seleccionada.","invalid":"No se puede calcular con estos valores. Compruebe las condiciones de uso.","unavailable":"El servicio de cálculo no está disponible. Inténtelo de nuevo.","connection":"No se pudo consultar el servicio de cálculo. Compruebe la conexión e inténtelo de nuevo.","check":"Compruebe los valores introducidos.","fleischner":"Antes de calcular: referencia para nódulos pulmonares incidentales. Las recomendaciones no se aplican a menores de 35 años, cribado de cáncer de pulmón, inmunosupresión o cáncer primario conocido.","incompleteAssessment":"No se puede calcular el total sin una evaluación completa."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · código de integración","clinical":"No se ha realizado una revisión clínica independiente.","conditions":"condiciones, fuentes y permisos","record":"Ficha y referencias","code":"Código JavaScript","cases":"Casos de referencia","language":"Idioma","formula":"Fórmula documentada","edition":"Edición del método","limits":"Límites y población","references":"Referencias"}},"fr":{"tool":{"id":"vef1-dlco-pos-operatorio","title":"VEMS et DLCO prédits postopératoires","titleLocale":"fr","summary":"Risque de résection pulmonaire selon le nombre de segments","lead":"Pour une lobectomie ou une segmentectomie, le calcul utilise le décompte initial des segments fonctionnels (19 moins les segments obstrués). Pour une pneumonectomie, il exige le pourcentage mesuré de la perfusion totale attribuable au poumon à réséquer. La méthode segmentaire ne remplace pas cette mesure. La fonction prédite est calculée dans ELUCENIA ; ce résultat seul ne constitue pas une autorisation opératoire.","fields":[["mode","Méthode d’estimation","sel",{"opt":true,"defaultValue":"segmental","opts":{"segmental":"Décompte des segments fonctionnels","perfusion":"Perfusion pulmonaire mesurée"},"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr","optionLocales":{"segmental":"fr","perfusion":"fr"}}],["vef1","VEMS préopératoire (après bronchodilatateur)","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% de la valeur théorique","ph":"75","unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["dlco","DLCO préopératoire","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% de la valeur théorique","ph":"70","opt":true,"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["seg","Segments <strong>fonctionnels</strong> à réséquer","num",{"min":1,"max":19,"ph":"5","integer":true,"step":1,"opt":true,"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["obs","Segments obstrués (non fonctionnels) dans l’ensemble du poumon","num",{"min":0,"max":18,"ph":"0","opt":true,"integer":true,"step":1,"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}],["perfusao","Perfusion du poumon à réséquer","num",{"min":0,"max":100,"unit":"% de la perfusion totale","ph":"50","opt":true,"unitLocale":"fr","displayLocale":"fr"}]],"formula":"<p><strong>Mode segmentaire :</strong> PPO = valeur préopératoire × (1 − y/z), où y est le nombre de segments fonctionnels à réséquer et z = 19 moins le nombre de segments obstrués. Les segments sont des nombres entiers et y ne peut pas dépasser z.</p><p><strong>Mode par perfusion :</strong> PPO = valeur préopératoire × (1 − P/100), où P est le pourcentage mesuré de la perfusion totale attribuable au poumon à réséquer. Cette fraction n’est pas déduite du décompte des segments.</p><p>L’équation s’applique séparément au VEMS et à la DLCO. Sans DLCO, le résultat est un VEMS partiel et l’évaluation reste incomplète. Le choix clinique de l’intervention et de la stratégie d’évaluation nécessite une revue professionnelle.</p>","sources":[["Brunelli A et al. Physiologic evaluation of the patient with lung cancer being considered for resectional surgery: diagnosis and management of lung cancer, 3rd ed: American College of Chest Physicians evidence-based clinical practice guidelines. Chest, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.1378/chest.12-2395"],["Brunelli A et al. ERS/ESTS clinical guidelines on fitness for radical therapy in lung cancer patients (surgery and chemo-radiotherapy). Eur Respir J, 2009.","https://doi.org/10.1183/09031936.00184308"]],"methodVersion":"ERS/ESTS 2009, page 22 : estimation initiale à partir des segments fonctionnels et formule avant pneumonectomie utilisant la fraction de perfusion mesurée ; seuils du résumé ACCP 2013 : les deux >60%, l’un entre 30–60% et l’un <30% ; aucune conformité clinique intégrale","methodVersionLocale":"fr","limits":"Estimation pour l’évaluation fonctionnelle des candidats à une résection pulmonaire, avec des valeurs préopératoires exprimées en pourcentage de la valeur prédite. Choisissez la méthode adaptée à l’intervention : décompte segmentaire pour une estimation initiale ; pour une pneumonectomie, renseignez la perfusion mesurée du poumon à réséquer. La perfusion n’est pas déduite de 19 segments. Saisissez les segments sous forme de nombres entiers ; le nombre à réséquer ne peut pas dépasser 19 moins les segments obstrués. Une perfusion de 0–100% correspond au domaine mathématique de l’implémentation ; 0% et 100% ne démontrent pas l’éligibilité à une intervention chirurgicale. Sans DLCO, seuls un VEMS partiel et une évaluation incomplète sont disponibles. Les algorithmes cardiovasculaires, les tests d’exercice, le correctif de 2014 et l’article ACCP intégral n’ont pas été vérifiés dans ce lot. La source ERS/ESTS 2009 a été lue sur cette page précise ; la source ACCP 2013, dans son résumé. Aucune revue clinique ni traduction professionnelle n’a été réalisée.","limitsLocale":"fr","resultLabels":{"Menor valor previsto pós-operatório (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"Valeur postopératoire prédite la plus faible (VEMS ou DLCO)","VEF₁ previsto pós-operatório":"VEMS postopératoire prédit","Menor valor PPO por perfusão (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"Valeur PPO la plus basse par perfusion (VEMS ou DLCO)","VEF₁ parcial por perfusão: DLCO não informada":"VEMS partiel par perfusion : DLCO non renseignée","VEF₁ parcial: DLCO não informada":"Estimation partielle du VEMS : DLCO non renseignée","VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios":"VEMS et DLCO prédits postopératoires"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Sélectionner","yes":"Oui","no":"Non","optional":"facultatif","numeric":"Valeur numérique","range":"intervalle","calculate":"Calculer","calculating":"Calcul en cours…","clear":"Effacer","heading":"Calculer en toute transparence","intro":"Vérifiez la population, les unités et la version. Le résultat présente la formule ou la classification, sans décision thérapeutique automatique.","restricted":"Fiche disponible à la consultation","restrictedNote":"Calcul suspendu dans cette version. L’inventaire, la révision en attente et les sources restent publics.","resultNote":"Résultat de la formule ou de la classification. L’interprétation, la conduite et l’applicabilité dépendent de l’évaluation professionnelle et de la source sélectionnée.","invalid":"Calcul impossible avec ces valeurs. Vérifiez les conditions d’utilisation.","unavailable":"Le service de calcul est indisponible. Réessayez.","connection":"Impossible de joindre le service de calcul. Vérifiez la connexion et réessayez.","check":"Vérifiez les valeurs saisies.","fleischner":"Avant le calcul : référence pour les nodules pulmonaires fortuits. Les recommandations ne s’appliquent pas aux personnes de moins de 35 ans, au dépistage du cancer du poumon, à l’immunosuppression ou à un cancer primitif connu.","incompleteAssessment":"Le total ne peut pas être calculé sans évaluation complète."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · code d’intégration","clinical":"Aucune révision clinique indépendante n’a été effectuée.","conditions":"conditions, sources et autorisations","record":"Fiche et références","code":"Code JavaScript","cases":"Cas de référence","language":"Langue","formula":"Formule documentée","edition":"Édition de la méthode","limits":"Limites et population","references":"Références"}},"de":{"tool":{"id":"vef1-dlco-pos-operatorio","title":"Vorhergesagte postoperative FEV₁ und DLCO","titleLocale":"de","summary":"Risiko einer Lungenresektion nach Segmentzählung","lead":"Bei Lobektomie oder Segmentektomie wird die anfängliche Zahl funktionsfähiger Segmente verwendet (19 abzüglich der obstruierten Segmente). Bei Pneumonektomie ist der gemessene Anteil der Gesamtperfusion erforderlich, der auf die zu resezierende Lunge entfällt. Die segmentale Methode ersetzt diese Messung nicht. Die vorhergesagte Funktion wird innerhalb von ELUCENIA berechnet; dieses einzelne Ergebnis erteilt keine Freigabe zur Operation.","fields":[["mode","Schätzmethode","sel",{"opt":true,"defaultValue":"segmental","opts":{"segmental":"Zählung funktionsfähiger Segmente","perfusion":"Gemessene Lungenperfusion"},"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de","optionLocales":{"segmental":"de","perfusion":"de"}}],["vef1","Präoperative FEV₁ (nach Bronchodilatation)","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% des Sollwerts","ph":"75","unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["dlco","Präoperative DLCO","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% des Sollwerts","ph":"70","opt":true,"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["seg","Zu resezierende <strong>funktionsfähige</strong> Segmente","num",{"min":1,"max":19,"ph":"5","integer":true,"step":1,"opt":true,"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["obs","Obstruierte (nicht funktionsfähige) Segmente in der gesamten Lunge","num",{"min":0,"max":18,"ph":"0","opt":true,"integer":true,"step":1,"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}],["perfusao","Perfusion der zu resezierenden Lunge","num",{"min":0,"max":100,"unit":"% der Gesamtperfusion","ph":"50","opt":true,"unitLocale":"de","displayLocale":"de"}]],"formula":"<p><strong>Segmentaler Modus:</strong> PPO = präoperativer Wert × (1 − y/z), wobei y die Zahl der zu resezierenden funktionsfähigen Segmente und z = 19 abzüglich der Zahl obstruierter Segmente ist. Segmente werden als ganze Zahlen gezählt, und y darf z nicht überschreiten.</p><p><strong>Perfusionsmodus:</strong> PPO = präoperativer Wert × (1 − P/100), wobei P der gemessene prozentuale Anteil der Gesamtperfusion ist, der auf die zu resezierende Lunge entfällt. Dieser Anteil wird nicht aus der Segmentzahl abgeleitet.</p><p>Die Gleichung wird getrennt auf FEV₁ und DLCO angewendet. Ohne DLCO liegt nur eine Teilberechnung des FEV₁ vor; die Beurteilung bleibt unvollständig. Die klinische Wahl des Eingriffs und der Beurteilungsstrategie erfordert eine fachliche Prüfung.</p>","sources":[["Brunelli A et al. Physiologic evaluation of the patient with lung cancer being considered for resectional surgery: diagnosis and management of lung cancer, 3rd ed: American College of Chest Physicians evidence-based clinical practice guidelines. Chest, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.1378/chest.12-2395"],["Brunelli A et al. ERS/ESTS clinical guidelines on fitness for radical therapy in lung cancer patients (surgery and chemo-radiotherapy). Eur Respir J, 2009.","https://doi.org/10.1183/09031936.00184308"]],"methodVersion":"ERS/ESTS 2009, Seite 22: erste Schätzung anhand funktionsfähiger Segmente und Formel vor Pneumonektomie mit gemessenem Perfusionsanteil; Grenzwerte aus dem Abstract der ACCP 2013: beide >60%, einer zwischen 30–60% und einer <30%; keine vollständige klinische Konformität","methodVersionLocale":"de","limits":"Schätzung zur funktionellen Beurteilung von Kandidaten für eine Lungenresektion; präoperative Werte werden als Prozent des Sollwerts angegeben. Wählen Sie die zum Eingriff passende Methode: Segmentzählung als erste Schätzung; bei Pneumonektomie geben Sie die gemessene Perfusion der zu resezierenden Lunge an. Die Perfusion wird nicht aus 19 Segmenten abgeleitet. Geben Sie Segmente als ganze Zahlen an; die zu resezierende Anzahl darf 19 abzüglich der obstruierten Segmente nicht überschreiten. Eine Perfusion von 0–100% ist der mathematische Definitionsbereich der Implementierung; 0% und 100% belegen keine operative Eignung. Ohne DLCO liegen nur eine Teilberechnung des FEV₁ und eine unvollständige Beurteilung vor. Kardiovaskuläre Algorithmen, Belastungstests, die Korrektur von 2014 und der vollständige ACCP-Artikel wurden in diesem Paket nicht geprüft. Die Quelle ERS/ESTS 2009 wurde auf dieser konkreten Seite gelesen, die Quelle ACCP 2013 im Abstract. Eine klinische Prüfung und professionelle Übersetzung wurden nicht durchgeführt.","limitsLocale":"de","resultLabels":{"Menor valor previsto pós-operatório (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"Niedrigerer vorhergesagter postoperativer Wert (FEV₁ oder DLCO)","VEF₁ previsto pós-operatório":"Vorhergesagter postoperativer FEV₁","Menor valor PPO por perfusão (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"Niedrigerer perfusionsbasierter PPO-Wert (FEV₁ oder DLCO)","VEF₁ parcial por perfusão: DLCO não informada":"Teilberechnung des FEV₁ anhand der Perfusion: DLCO nicht angegeben","VEF₁ parcial: DLCO não informada":"Partielle FEV₁-Schätzung: DLCO nicht angegeben","VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios":"Vorhergesagte postoperative FEV₁ und DLCO"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Auswählen","yes":"Ja","no":"Nein","optional":"optional","numeric":"Numerischer Wert","range":"Bereich","calculate":"Berechnen","calculating":"Berechnung läuft…","clear":"Löschen","heading":"Transparent berechnen","intro":"Prüfen Sie Population, Einheiten und Version. Das Ergebnis zeigt die Formel oder Klassifikation, ohne automatisch eine Therapieentscheidung zu treffen.","restricted":"Eintrag zur Einsicht verfügbar","restrictedNote":"Die Berechnung ist in dieser Version ausgesetzt. Inventar, ausstehende Prüfung und Quellen bleiben öffentlich.","resultNote":"Ergebnis der Formel oder Klassifikation. Interpretation, Vorgehen und Anwendbarkeit hängen von der fachlichen Beurteilung und der ausgewählten Quelle ab.","invalid":"Berechnung mit diesen Werten nicht möglich. Prüfen Sie die Nutzungsbedingungen.","unavailable":"Der Berechnungsdienst ist nicht verfügbar. Versuchen Sie es erneut.","connection":"Der Berechnungsdienst ist nicht erreichbar. Prüfen Sie die Verbindung und versuchen Sie es erneut.","check":"Prüfen Sie die eingegebenen Werte.","fleischner":"Vor der Berechnung: Referenz für zufällig entdeckte Lungenrundherde. Die Empfehlungen gelten nicht für Personen unter 35 Jahren, Lungenkrebs-Screening, Immunsuppression oder bekannten Primärkrebs.","incompleteAssessment":"Ohne vollständige Untersuchung lässt sich kein Gesamtscore berechnen."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · Integrationscode","clinical":"Eine unabhängige klinische Prüfung wurde nicht durchgeführt.","conditions":"Bedingungen, Quellen und Berechtigungen","record":"Eintrag und Referenzen","code":"JavaScript-Code","cases":"Referenzfälle","language":"Sprache","formula":"Dokumentierte Formel","edition":"Fassung der Methode","limits":"Grenzen und Population","references":"Referenzen"}},"it":{"tool":{"id":"vef1-dlco-pos-operatorio","title":"FEV₁ e DLCO previsti postoperatori","titleLocale":"it","summary":"Rischio di resezione polmonare dal conteggio dei segmenti","lead":"Per la lobectomia o la segmentectomia, utilizza il conteggio iniziale dei segmenti funzionanti (19 meno quelli ostruiti). Per la pneumonectomia, richiede la percentuale misurata della perfusione totale attribuibile al polmone da resecare. Il metodo segmentario non sostituisce questa misurazione. La funzione prevista viene calcolata all’interno di ELUCENIA; il risultato isolato non autorizza l’intervento chirurgico.","fields":[["mode","Metodo di stima","sel",{"opt":true,"defaultValue":"segmental","opts":{"segmental":"Conteggio dei segmenti funzionanti","perfusion":"Perfusione polmonare misurata"},"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it","optionLocales":{"segmental":"it","perfusion":"it"}}],["vef1","FEV₁ preoperatorio (dopo broncodilatatore)","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% del valore previsto","ph":"75","unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["dlco","DLCO preoperatoria","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% del valore previsto","ph":"70","opt":true,"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["seg","Segmenti <strong>funzionanti</strong> da resecare","num",{"min":1,"max":19,"ph":"5","integer":true,"step":1,"opt":true,"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["obs","Segmenti ostruiti (non funzionanti) dell’intero polmone","num",{"min":0,"max":18,"ph":"0","opt":true,"integer":true,"step":1,"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}],["perfusao","Perfusione del polmone da resecare","num",{"min":0,"max":100,"unit":"% della perfusione totale","ph":"50","opt":true,"unitLocale":"it","displayLocale":"it"}]],"formula":"<p><strong>Modalità segmentaria:</strong> PPO = valore preoperatorio × (1 − y/z), dove y è il numero di segmenti funzionanti da resecare e z = 19 meno il numero di segmenti ostruiti. I segmenti sono conteggi interi e y non può superare z.</p><p><strong>Modalità mediante perfusione:</strong> PPO = valore preoperatorio × (1 − P/100), dove P è la percentuale misurata della perfusione totale attribuibile al polmone da resecare. Questa frazione non viene dedotta dal conteggio dei segmenti.</p><p>L’equazione viene applicata separatamente al VEMS e alla DLCO. Senza DLCO, il risultato è un VEMS parziale e la valutazione rimane incompleta. La scelta clinica dell’intervento e della strategia di valutazione richiede una revisione professionale.</p>","sources":[["Brunelli A et al. Physiologic evaluation of the patient with lung cancer being considered for resectional surgery: diagnosis and management of lung cancer, 3rd ed: American College of Chest Physicians evidence-based clinical practice guidelines. Chest, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.1378/chest.12-2395"],["Brunelli A et al. ERS/ESTS clinical guidelines on fitness for radical therapy in lung cancer patients (surgery and chemo-radiotherapy). Eur Respir J, 2009.","https://doi.org/10.1183/09031936.00184308"]],"methodVersion":"ERS/ESTS 2009, pagina 22: stima iniziale mediante segmenti funzionanti e formula prima della pneumonectomia basata sulla frazione di perfusione misurata; soglie del riassunto ACCP 2013: entrambi >60%, uno tra 30–60% e uno <30%; nessuna conformità clinica integrale","methodVersionLocale":"it","limits":"Stima per la valutazione funzionale dei candidati a resezione polmonare, con valori preoperatori espressi come percentuale del previsto. Scegliere il metodo compatibile con l’intervento: conteggio segmentario come stima iniziale; nella pneumonectomia, inserire la perfusione misurata del polmone da resecare. La perfusione non viene dedotta da 19 segmenti. Inserire i segmenti come conteggi interi; il numero da resecare non può superare 19 meno quelli ostruiti. La perfusione di 0–100% è il dominio matematico dell’implementazione; 0% e 100% non dimostrano l’idoneità chirurgica. Senza DLCO, sono disponibili solo un VEMS parziale e una valutazione incompleta. Gli algoritmi cardiovascolari, i test da sforzo, la correzione del 2014 e l’articolo ACCP integrale non sono stati verificati in questo lotto. La fonte ERS/ESTS 2009 è stata letta in questa pagina specifica; la fonte ACCP 2013, nel riassunto. Non sono state eseguite una revisione clinica né una traduzione professionale.","limitsLocale":"it","resultLabels":{"Menor valor previsto pós-operatório (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"Valore postoperatorio previsto minore (VEMS o DLCO)","VEF₁ previsto pós-operatório":"VEMS postoperatorio previsto","Menor valor PPO por perfusão (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"Valore PPO inferiore mediante perfusione (VEMS o DLCO)","VEF₁ parcial por perfusão: DLCO não informada":"VEMS parziale mediante perfusione: DLCO non fornita","VEF₁ parcial: DLCO não informada":"Stima parziale del FEV₁: DLCO non indicata","VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios":"FEV₁ e DLCO previsti postoperatori"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"Seleziona","yes":"Sì","no":"No","optional":"facoltativo","numeric":"Valore numerico","range":"intervallo","calculate":"Calcola","calculating":"Calcolo in corso…","clear":"Cancella","heading":"Calcolare con trasparenza","intro":"Verifica popolazione, unità e versione. Il risultato mostra la formula o la classificazione, senza una decisione terapeutica automatica.","restricted":"Scheda disponibile per consultazione","restrictedNote":"Calcolo sospeso in questa versione. Inventario, revisione in sospeso e fonti rimangono pubblici.","resultNote":"Risultato della formula o classificazione. Interpretazione, condotta e applicabilità dipendono dalla valutazione professionale e dalla fonte selezionata.","invalid":"Impossibile calcolare con questi valori. Verifica le condizioni d’uso.","unavailable":"Il servizio di calcolo non è disponibile. Riprova.","connection":"Impossibile contattare il servizio di calcolo. Verifica la connessione e riprova.","check":"Verifica i valori inseriti.","fleischner":"Prima del calcolo: riferimento per noduli polmonari incidentali. Le raccomandazioni non si applicano a persone di età inferiore a 35 anni, screening del cancro del polmone, immunosoppressione o tumore primario noto.","incompleteAssessment":"Il totale non può essere calcolato senza una valutazione completa."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · codice di integrazione","clinical":"Non è stata effettuata una revisione clinica indipendente.","conditions":"condizioni, fonti e autorizzazioni","record":"Scheda e riferimenti","code":"Codice JavaScript","cases":"Casi di riferimento","language":"Lingua","formula":"Formula documentata","edition":"Edizione del metodo","limits":"Limiti e popolazione","references":"Riferimenti"}},"ar":{"tool":{"id":"vef1-dlco-pos-operatorio","title":"FEV₁ وDLCO المتوقعان بعد الجراحة","titleLocale":"ar","summary":"خطر استئصال الرئة بعدّ القطاعات","lead":"لاستئصال فص أو قطعة رئوية، يستخدم العدد الأولي للقطع الوظيفية (١٩ ناقص القطع المسدودة). لاستئصال الرئة كاملةً، يتطلب النسبة المئوية المقاسة من إجمالي التروية التي تخص الرئة المزمع استئصالها. لا تحل طريقة عدّ القطع محل هذا القياس. تُحسب الوظيفة المتوقعة داخل ELUCENIA؛ ولا تمنح هذه النتيجة وحدها موافقة على الجراحة.","fields":[["mode","طريقة التقدير","sel",{"opt":true,"defaultValue":"segmental","opts":{"segmental":"عدّ القطع الرئوية الوظيفية","perfusion":"التروية الرئوية المقاسة"},"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar","optionLocales":{"segmental":"ar","perfusion":"ar"}}],["vef1","FEV₁ قبل الجراحة (بعد موسع القصبات)","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% من القيمة المتوقعة","ph":"٧٥","unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["dlco","DLCO قبل الجراحة","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% من القيمة المتوقعة","ph":"٧٠","opt":true,"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["seg","القطع <strong>الوظيفية</strong> التي ستُستأصل","num",{"min":1,"max":19,"ph":"٥","integer":true,"step":1,"opt":true,"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["obs","القطع المسدودة (غير الوظيفية) في كامل الرئتين","num",{"min":0,"max":18,"ph":"٠","opt":true,"integer":true,"step":1,"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}],["perfusao","تروية الرئة المزمع استئصالها","num",{"min":0,"max":100,"unit":"٪ من إجمالي التروية","ph":"٥٠","opt":true,"unitLocale":"ar","displayLocale":"ar"}]],"formula":"<p><strong>طريقة عدّ القطع:</strong> PPO = القيمة قبل الجراحة × (١ − y/z)، حيث y هو عدد القطع الوظيفية المزمع استئصالها وz = ١٩ ناقص عدد القطع المسدودة. تُدخل القطع كأعداد صحيحة، ولا يجوز أن يتجاوز y قيمة z.</p><p><strong>طريقة التروية:</strong> PPO = القيمة قبل الجراحة × (١ − P/١٠٠)، حيث P هي النسبة المئوية المقاسة من إجمالي التروية التي تخص الرئة المزمع استئصالها. لا يُستنتج هذا الكسر من عدد القطع.</p><p>تُطبّق المعادلة بصورة منفصلة على FEV₁ وعلى DLCO. من دون DLCO، تكون النتيجة حسابًا جزئيًا لـFEV₁ ويبقى التقييم غير مكتمل. يتطلب الاختيار السريري للتدخل واستراتيجية التقييم مراجعةً مهنيةً.</p>","sources":[["Brunelli A et al. Physiologic evaluation of the patient with lung cancer being considered for resectional surgery: diagnosis and management of lung cancer, 3rd ed: American College of Chest Physicians evidence-based clinical practice guidelines. Chest, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.1378/chest.12-2395"],["Brunelli A et al. ERS/ESTS clinical guidelines on fitness for radical therapy in lung cancer patients (surgery and chemo-radiotherapy). Eur Respir J, 2009.","https://doi.org/10.1183/09031936.00184308"]],"methodVersion":"ERS/ESTS 2009، الصفحة ٢٢: تقدير أولي باستخدام القطع الوظيفية ومعادلة ما قبل استئصال الرئة باستخدام كسر التروية المقاس؛ حدود ملخص ACCP 2013: كلتاهما >٦٠٪، وأي منهما بين ٣٠–٦٠٪، وأي منهما <٣٠٪؛ من دون مطابقة سريرية كاملة","methodVersionLocale":"ar","limits":"تقدير للتقييم الوظيفي للمرشحين لاستئصال الرئة، مع التعبير عن القيم قبل الجراحة كنسب مئوية من القيم المتوقعة. اختر الطريقة المناسبة للتدخل: عدّ القطع كتقدير أولي؛ وعند استئصال الرئة كاملةً، أدخل التروية المقاسة للرئة المزمع استئصالها. لا تُستنتج التروية من ١٩ قطعة. أدخل القطع كأعداد صحيحة؛ ولا يجوز أن يتجاوز العدد المزمع استئصاله ١٩ ناقص القطع المسدودة. التروية من ٠–١٠٠٪ هي المجال الرياضي لهذه البرمجة؛ ولا تثبت القيمتان ٠٪ و١٠٠٪ الأهلية للجراحة. من دون DLCO، يتوفر فقط حساب جزئي لـFEV₁ وتقييم غير مكتمل. لم تُفحص في هذه الدفعة الخوارزميات القلبية الوعائية أو اختبارات الجهد أو تصحيح 2014 أو مقالة ACCP كاملةً. قُرئت هذه الصفحة المحددة من مصدر ERS/ESTS 2009، وملخص مصدر ACCP 2013. لم تُجرَ مراجعة سريرية أو ترجمة مهنية.","limitsLocale":"ar","resultLabels":{"Menor valor previsto pós-operatório (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"أدنى قيمة متوقعة بعد الجراحة (FEV₁ أوDLCO)","VEF₁ previsto pós-operatório":"FEV₁ المتوقع بعد الجراحة","Menor valor PPO por perfusão (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"القيمة الأقل من قيم PPO المحسوبة بالتروية (FEV₁ أو DLCO)","VEF₁ parcial por perfusão: DLCO não informada":"حساب جزئي لـFEV₁ باستخدام التروية: لم تُدخل DLCO","VEF₁ parcial: DLCO não informada":"تقدير جزئي لحجم الزفير القسري في الثانية الأولى (FEV₁): لم تُقدَّم قيمة DLCO","VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios":"FEV₁ وDLCO المتوقعان بعد الجراحة"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"اختر","yes":"نعم","no":"لا","optional":"اختياري","numeric":"قيمة رقمية","range":"النطاق","calculate":"احسب","calculating":"جارٍ الحساب…","clear":"مسح","heading":"حساب بشفافية","intro":"تحقق من الفئة السكانية والوحدات والإصدار. تعرض النتيجة المعادلة أو التصنيف دون اتخاذ قرار علاجي تلقائي.","restricted":"السجل متاح للاطلاع","restrictedNote":"الحساب معلّق في هذا الإصدار. يظل السجل والمراجعة المعلّقة والمصادر متاحة للعامة.","resultNote":"نتيجة المعادلة أو التصنيف. يعتمد التفسير والتصرف ومدى الانطباق على التقييم المهني والمصدر المحدد.","invalid":"تعذر الحساب بهذه القيم. تحقق من شروط الاستخدام.","unavailable":"خدمة الحساب غير متاحة. حاول مرة أخرى.","connection":"تعذر الاتصال بخدمة الحساب. تحقق من الاتصال وحاول مرة أخرى.","check":"تحقق من القيم المدخلة.","fleischner":"قبل الحساب: مرجع للعقيدات الرئوية المكتشفة عرضًا. لا تنطبق التوصيات على من هم دون 35 عامًا، أو فحص سرطان الرئة، أو كبت المناعة، أو وجود سرطان أولي معروف.","incompleteAssessment":"لا يمكن حساب المجموع دون تقييم مكتمل."},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · شيفرة التكامل","clinical":"لم تُجرَ مراجعة سريرية مستقلة.","conditions":"الشروط والمصادر والأذونات","record":"السجل والمراجع","code":"شيفرة JavaScript","cases":"حالات مرجعية","language":"اللغة","formula":"المعادلة الموثقة","edition":"إصدار الطريقة","limits":"الحدود والفئة السكانية","references":"المراجع"}},"zh":{"tool":{"id":"vef1-dlco-pos-operatorio","title":"术后预计 FEV₁ 与 DLCO","titleLocale":"zh","summary":"肺切除风险：肺段计数","lead":"肺叶或肺段切除时，使用初始功能性肺段数（19减去阻塞肺段数）。全肺切除时，必须输入实测的拟切除肺灌注占总灌注的百分比。肺段计数法不能替代这一测量。预计功能在ELUCENIA内计算；仅凭这一结果不能批准手术。","fields":[["mode","估算方法","sel",{"opt":true,"defaultValue":"segmental","opts":{"segmental":"功能性肺段计数","perfusion":"实测肺灌注"},"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh","optionLocales":{"segmental":"zh","perfusion":"zh"}}],["vef1","术前 FEV₁（支气管舒张后）","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"%预计值","ph":"75","unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["dlco","术前 DLCO","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"%预计值","ph":"70","opt":true,"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["seg","拟切除的<strong>有功能</strong>肺段","num",{"min":1,"max":19,"ph":"5","integer":true,"step":1,"opt":true,"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["obs","全肺阻塞（无功能）肺段","num",{"min":0,"max":18,"ph":"0","opt":true,"integer":true,"step":1,"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}],["perfusao","拟切除肺的灌注","num",{"min":0,"max":100,"unit":"占总灌注的百分比","ph":"50","opt":true,"unitLocale":"zh","displayLocale":"zh"}]],"formula":"<p><strong>肺段计数模式：</strong>PPO = 术前值 × (1 − y/z)，其中y是拟切除的功能性肺段数，z = 19减去阻塞肺段数。肺段数必须为整数，且y不能大于z。</p><p><strong>灌注模式：</strong>PPO = 术前值 × (1 − P/100)，其中P是实测的拟切除肺灌注占总灌注的百分比。该比例不能由肺段数推算。</p><p>该公式分别应用于FEV₁和DLCO。没有DLCO时，只能得到部分FEV₁结果，评估仍不完整。临床干预及评估策略的选择需要专业复核。</p>","sources":[["Brunelli A et al. Physiologic evaluation of the patient with lung cancer being considered for resectional surgery: diagnosis and management of lung cancer, 3rd ed: American College of Chest Physicians evidence-based clinical practice guidelines. Chest, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.1378/chest.12-2395"],["Brunelli A et al. ERS/ESTS clinical guidelines on fitness for radical therapy in lung cancer patients (surgery and chemo-radiotherapy). Eur Respir J, 2009.","https://doi.org/10.1183/09031936.00184308"]],"methodVersion":"ERS/ESTS 2009，第22页：根据功能性肺段作初始估算，以及利用实测灌注比例计算全肺切除前的预计值；ACCP 2013摘要中的阈值：两项都>60%、任一项处于30–60%、任一项<30%；未确认完整临床一致性","methodVersionLocale":"zh","limits":"用于肺切除候选者功能评估的估算，术前值以预计值的百分比表示。选择与干预相符的方法：肺段计数用于初始估算；全肺切除时，输入拟切除肺的实测灌注。不能根据19个肺段推算灌注。肺段数应输入整数；拟切除数不能超过19减去阻塞肺段数。0–100%的灌注是本实现的数学定义域；0%和100%不能证明符合手术条件。没有DLCO时，只能得到部分FEV₁结果，评估不完整。本批次未核查心血管评估算法、运动试验、2014年更正及ACCP全文。ERS/ESTS 2009来源仅阅读了这一特定页，ACCP 2013来源仅阅读了摘要。未进行临床复核或专业翻译。","limitsLocale":"zh","resultLabels":{"Menor valor previsto pós-operatório (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"较低的术后预计值（FEV₁ 或 DLCO）","VEF₁ previsto pós-operatório":"术后预计 FEV₁","Menor valor PPO por perfusão (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"灌注法计算的较低PPO值（FEV₁或DLCO）","VEF₁ parcial por perfusão: DLCO não informada":"灌注法部分FEV₁结果：未提供DLCO","VEF₁ parcial: DLCO não informada":"部分FEV₁估算：未提供DLCO","VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios":"术后预计 FEV₁ 与 DLCO"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"请选择","yes":"是","no":"否","optional":"选填","numeric":"数值","range":"范围","calculate":"计算","calculating":"计算中…","clear":"清除","heading":"透明计算","intro":"请核对适用人群、单位和版本。结果展示公式或分类，不自动作出治疗决定。","restricted":"可查阅工具记录","restrictedNote":"本版本暂停计算。清单、待审事项和来源仍公开。","resultNote":"公式或分类结果。解释、处理及适用性须结合专业评估和所选来源。","invalid":"无法使用这些数值计算。请核对使用条件。","unavailable":"计算服务暂不可用。请重试。","connection":"无法连接计算服务。请检查网络后重试。","check":"请检查输入值。","fleischner":"计算前：此参考适用于偶然发现的肺结节。建议不适用于35岁以下人群、肺癌筛查、免疫抑制或已知原发性癌症患者。","incompleteAssessment":"未完成评估，无法计算总分。"},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · 集成代码","clinical":"尚未开展独立临床审查。","conditions":"条件、来源与许可","record":"记录与参考文献","code":"JavaScript代码","cases":"参考案例","language":"语言","formula":"已记录的公式","edition":"方法版本","limits":"限制与适用人群","references":"参考文献"}},"ja":{"tool":{"id":"vef1-dlco-pos-operatorio","title":"予測術後FEV₁・DLCO","titleLocale":"ja","summary":"区域数による肺切除リスク","lead":"肺葉切除または肺区域切除では、初期の機能している肺区域数（19から閉塞区域数を引いた数）を使用します。肺全摘術では、切除予定の肺が総肺血流に占める実測割合が必要です。区域数による方法はこの測定の代わりにはなりません。予測機能はELUCENIA内で計算されますが、この結果だけでは手術を承認できません。","fields":[["mode","推定方法","sel",{"opt":true,"defaultValue":"segmental","opts":{"segmental":"機能している肺区域の数","perfusion":"測定された肺血流"},"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja","optionLocales":{"segmental":"ja","perfusion":"ja"}}],["vef1","術前FEV₁（気管支拡張薬後）","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"%予測値","ph":"75","unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["dlco","術前DLCO","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"%予測値","ph":"70","opt":true,"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["seg","切除予定の<strong>機能している</strong>肺区域","num",{"min":1,"max":19,"ph":"5","integer":true,"step":1,"opt":true,"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["obs","肺全体の閉塞した（非機能）区域","num",{"min":0,"max":18,"ph":"0","opt":true,"integer":true,"step":1,"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}],["perfusao","切除予定の肺の血流","num",{"min":0,"max":100,"unit":"総肺血流に対する割合（%）","ph":"50","opt":true,"unitLocale":"ja","displayLocale":"ja"}]],"formula":"<p><strong>区域数によるモード：</strong>PPO = 術前値 × (1 − y/z)。yは切除予定の機能している肺区域数、z = 19から閉塞区域数を引いた数です。区域数は整数で入力し、yはzを超えてはいけません。</p><p><strong>肺血流によるモード：</strong>PPO = 術前値 × (1 − P/100)。Pは切除予定の肺が総肺血流に占める実測百分率です。この割合を区域数から推定することはありません。</p><p>この式をFEV₁とDLCOに別々に適用します。DLCOがなければFEV₁のみの部分的な計算となり、評価は不完全なままです。臨床的な介入と評価方針の選択には専門家による確認が必要です。</p>","sources":[["Brunelli A et al. Physiologic evaluation of the patient with lung cancer being considered for resectional surgery: diagnosis and management of lung cancer, 3rd ed: American College of Chest Physicians evidence-based clinical practice guidelines. Chest, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.1378/chest.12-2395"],["Brunelli A et al. ERS/ESTS clinical guidelines on fitness for radical therapy in lung cancer patients (surgery and chemo-radiotherapy). Eur Respir J, 2009.","https://doi.org/10.1183/09031936.00184308"]],"methodVersion":"ERS/ESTS 2009、22ページ：機能している肺区域による初期推定と、実測肺血流比率を用いる肺全摘前の式。ACCP 2013の抄録の閾値は、両方>60%、いずれかが30–60%、いずれかが<30%。完全な臨床的適合性は確認していません","methodVersionLocale":"ja","limits":"肺切除候補者の機能評価のための推定で、術前値は予測値に対する百分率で示します。介入に適した方法を選択してください。区域数による計算は初期推定であり、肺全摘術では切除予定の肺の実測血流を入力します。19区域から肺血流を推定することはありません。区域数は整数で入力し、切除予定数は19から閉塞区域数を引いた数を超えてはいけません。血流0–100%は本実装の数学的定義域であり、0%と100%は手術適応を証明しません。DLCOがなければFEV₁のみの部分的な計算となり、評価は不完全です。このロットでは心血管評価アルゴリズム、運動試験、2014年の訂正、ACCP論文の全文は確認していません。ERS/ESTS 2009はこの特定ページのみ、ACCP 2013は抄録のみを読みました。臨床レビューおよび専門家による翻訳は行っていません。","limitsLocale":"ja","resultLabels":{"Menor valor previsto pós-operatório (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"予測術後値の低い方（FEV₁またはDLCO）","VEF₁ previsto pós-operatório":"予測術後FEV₁","Menor valor PPO por perfusão (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"肺血流法による低い方のPPO値（FEV₁またはDLCO）","VEF₁ parcial por perfusão: DLCO não informada":"肺血流法によるFEV₁のみの部分的計算：DLCO未入力","VEF₁ parcial: DLCO não informada":"FEV₁の部分推定：DLCO未入力","VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios":"予測術後FEV₁・DLCO"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"選択","yes":"はい","no":"いいえ","optional":"任意","numeric":"数値","range":"範囲","calculate":"計算","calculating":"計算中…","clear":"クリア","heading":"根拠を明示して計算","intro":"対象集団、単位、版を確認してください。結果は式または分類を示すもので、治療方針を自動決定しません。","restricted":"記録を参照できます","restrictedNote":"この版では計算を停止しています。目録、未完了の審査、出典は公開されています。","resultNote":"式または分類の結果です。解釈、対応、適用可能性は専門家による評価と選択した出典に依存します。","invalid":"この値では計算できません。使用条件を確認してください。","unavailable":"計算サービスを利用できません。再試行してください。","connection":"計算サービスに接続できません。接続を確認して再試行してください。","check":"入力値を確認してください。","fleischner":"計算前：偶発的に発見された肺結節に関する参考です。35歳未満、肺がん検診、免疫抑制、既知の原発がんには推奨を適用できません。","incompleteAssessment":"評価が完了していないため合計を計算できません。"},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · 連携コード","clinical":"独立した臨床レビューは実施されていません。","conditions":"条件・出典・許諾","record":"記録・参考文献","code":"JavaScriptコード","cases":"参照ケース","language":"言語","formula":"記載された計算式","edition":"方法の版","limits":"限界・対象集団","references":"参考文献"}},"hi":{"tool":{"id":"vef1-dlco-pos-operatorio","title":"सर्जरी के बाद अनुमानित FEV₁ और DLCO","titleLocale":"hi","summary":"खंड गिनती से फेफड़ा उच्छेदन जोखिम","lead":"लोबेक्टॉमी या सेगमेंटेक्टॉमी के लिए, कार्यशील खंडों की प्रारंभिक संख्या (19 में से अवरुद्ध खंड घटाकर) का उपयोग करता है। न्यूमोनेक्टॉमी के लिए, निकाले जाने वाले फेफड़े को मिलने वाले कुल परफ्यूज़न का मापा गया प्रतिशत आवश्यक है। खंड-आधारित विधि इस मापन का स्थान नहीं लेती। अनुमानित कार्यक्षमता की गणना ELUCENIA में होती है; अकेला परिणाम शल्यक्रिया की स्वीकृति नहीं देता।","fields":[["mode","अनुमान की विधि","sel",{"opt":true,"defaultValue":"segmental","opts":{"segmental":"कार्यशील फुफ्फुसीय खंडों की गणना","perfusion":"मापा गया फुफ्फुसीय परफ्यूज़न"},"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi","optionLocales":{"segmental":"hi","perfusion":"hi"}}],["vef1","ऑपरेशन से पहले FEV₁ (ब्रॉन्कोडाइलेटर के बाद)","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% अनुमानित मान","ph":"75","unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["dlco","ऑपरेशन से पहले DLCO","num",{"min":10,"max":150,"unit":"% अनुमानित मान","ph":"70","opt":true,"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["seg","हटाए जाने वाले <strong>कार्यशील</strong> सेगमेंट","num",{"min":1,"max":19,"ph":"5","integer":true,"step":1,"opt":true,"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["obs","पूरे फेफड़े में अवरुद्ध (गैर-कार्यशील) सेगमेंट","num",{"min":0,"max":18,"ph":"0","opt":true,"integer":true,"step":1,"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}],["perfusao","निकाले जाने वाले फेफड़े का परफ्यूज़न","num",{"min":0,"max":100,"unit":"कुल परफ्यूज़न का %","ph":"50","opt":true,"unitLocale":"hi","displayLocale":"hi"}]],"formula":"<p><strong>खंड-आधारित मोड:</strong> PPO = शल्यक्रिया-पूर्व मान × (1 − y/z), जहाँ y निकाले जाने वाले कार्यशील खंडों की संख्या है और z = 19 में से अवरुद्ध खंडों की संख्या घटाकर प्राप्त संख्या है। खंडों की संख्या पूर्णांक होती है और y, z से अधिक नहीं हो सकता।</p><p><strong>परफ्यूज़न-आधारित मोड:</strong> PPO = शल्यक्रिया-पूर्व मान × (1 − P/100), जहाँ P निकाले जाने वाले फेफड़े को मिलने वाले कुल परफ्यूज़न का मापा गया प्रतिशत है। इस अनुपात का अनुमान खंडों की संख्या से नहीं लगाया जाता।</p><p>समीकरण को FEV₁ और DLCO पर अलग-अलग लागू किया जाता है। DLCO नहीं होने पर केवल FEV₁ की आंशिक गणना मिलती है और मूल्यांकन अधूरा रहता है। हस्तक्षेप तथा मूल्यांकन रणनीति के नैदानिक चयन के लिए पेशेवर समीक्षा आवश्यक है।</p>","sources":[["Brunelli A et al. Physiologic evaluation of the patient with lung cancer being considered for resectional surgery: diagnosis and management of lung cancer, 3rd ed: American College of Chest Physicians evidence-based clinical practice guidelines. Chest, 2013.","https://doi.org/10.1378/chest.12-2395"],["Brunelli A et al. ERS/ESTS clinical guidelines on fitness for radical therapy in lung cancer patients (surgery and chemo-radiotherapy). Eur Respir J, 2009.","https://doi.org/10.1183/09031936.00184308"]],"methodVersion":"ERS/ESTS 2009, पृष्ठ 22: कार्यशील खंडों से प्रारंभिक अनुमान तथा मापे गए परफ्यूज़न अनुपात से न्यूमोनेक्टॉमी-पूर्व सूत्र; ACCP 2013 के सारांश के कटऑफ: दोनों >60%, कोई एक 30–60% के बीच और कोई एक <30%; पूर्ण नैदानिक अनुरूपता स्थापित नहीं","methodVersionLocale":"hi","limits":"फेफड़े के उच्छेदन के उम्मीदवारों के कार्यात्मक मूल्यांकन के लिए अनुमान; शल्यक्रिया-पूर्व मान अनुमानित सामान्य मान के प्रतिशत में होते हैं। हस्तक्षेप के अनुरूप विधि चुनें: प्रारंभिक अनुमान के लिए खंडों की गणना; न्यूमोनेक्टॉमी में निकाले जाने वाले फेफड़े का मापा गया परफ्यूज़न दर्ज करें। 19 खंडों से परफ्यूज़न का अनुमान नहीं लगाया जाता। खंडों को पूर्णांक संख्या में दर्ज करें; निकाले जाने वाले खंडों की संख्या, 19 में से अवरुद्ध खंडों की संख्या घटाकर प्राप्त संख्या से अधिक नहीं हो सकती। 0–100% परफ्यूज़न इस कार्यान्वयन का गणितीय परास है; 0% और 100% शल्यक्रिया की पात्रता सिद्ध नहीं करते। DLCO नहीं होने पर केवल FEV₁ की आंशिक गणना और अधूरा मूल्यांकन मिलता है। इस बैच में हृदय-वाहिका एल्गोरिदम, व्यायाम परीक्षण, 2014 का संशोधन और पूरा ACCP लेख नहीं जाँचा गया। ERS/ESTS 2009 स्रोत का केवल यह विशिष्ट पृष्ठ तथा ACCP 2013 स्रोत का केवल सारांश पढ़ा गया। नैदानिक समीक्षा और पेशेवर अनुवाद नहीं किए गए।","limitsLocale":"hi","resultLabels":{"Menor valor previsto pós-operatório (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"सर्जरी के बाद का कम अनुमानित मान (FEV₁ या DLCO)","VEF₁ previsto pós-operatório":"सर्जरी के बाद अनुमानित FEV₁","Menor valor PPO por perfusão (VEF₁ ou DLCO)":"परफ्यूज़न से प्राप्त कम PPO मान (FEV₁ या DLCO)","VEF₁ parcial por perfusão: DLCO não informada":"परफ्यूज़न से FEV₁ की आंशिक गणना: DLCO नहीं दिया गया","VEF₁ parcial: DLCO não informada":"FEV₁ का आंशिक अनुमान: DLCO नहीं दी गई","VEF₁ e DLCO previstos pós-operatórios":"सर्जरी के बाद अनुमानित FEV₁ और DLCO"},"resultUnits":{},"resultValues":{}},"shared":{"select":"चुनें","yes":"हाँ","no":"नहीं","optional":"वैकल्पिक","numeric":"संख्यात्मक मान","range":"सीमा","calculate":"गणना करें","calculating":"गणना जारी है…","clear":"साफ़ करें","heading":"पारदर्शिता के साथ गणना","intro":"जनसमूह, इकाइयाँ और संस्करण जाँचें। परिणाम सूत्र या वर्गीकरण दिखाता है; यह स्वतः उपचार संबंधी निर्णय नहीं देता।","restricted":"रिकॉर्ड देखने के लिए उपलब्ध है","restrictedNote":"इस संस्करण में गणना रुकी हुई है। सूची, लंबित समीक्षा और स्रोत सार्वजनिक हैं।","resultNote":"सूत्र या वर्गीकरण का परिणाम। व्याख्या, कार्यवाही और उपयुक्तता पेशेवर मूल्यांकन और चुने गए स्रोत पर निर्भर है।","invalid":"इन मानों से गणना नहीं हो सकी। उपयोग की शर्तें जाँचें।","unavailable":"गणना सेवा उपलब्ध नहीं है। फिर प्रयास करें।","connection":"गणना सेवा से संपर्क नहीं हो सका। कनेक्शन जाँचकर फिर प्रयास करें।","check":"दर्ज मान जाँचें।","fleischner":"गणना से पहले: आकस्मिक रूप से पाए गए फेफड़ों के नोड्यूल के लिए संदर्भ। सिफ़ारिशें 35 वर्ष से कम आयु, फेफड़ों के कैंसर की स्क्रीनिंग, प्रतिरक्षा दमन या ज्ञात प्राथमिक कैंसर पर लागू नहीं होतीं।","incompleteAssessment":"पूर्ण मूल्यांकन के बिना कुल स्कोर नहीं निकाला जा सकता।"},"ui":{"brand":"ELUCENIA · एकीकरण कोड","clinical":"स्वतंत्र नैदानिक समीक्षा नहीं की गई है।","conditions":"शर्तें, स्रोत और अनुमतियाँ","record":"रिकॉर्ड और संदर्भ","code":"JavaScript कोड","cases":"संदर्भ मामले","language":"भाषा","formula":"दस्तावेज़ित सूत्र","edition":"विधि का संस्करण","limits":"सीमाएँ और जनसमूह","references":"संदर्भ"}}}};
